    "num_matmul" => "Dense matrix product. Matrix product. # Errors Returns [`DenseError::Shape`] for incompatible matrix dimensions or storage.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
