    "num_native_colour_graph_set_colours" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Replaces the vertex colours. Returns `false` when `colours` does not have one entry per vertex.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
