    "num_native_engine_box_min_image_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Applies the minimum-image convention (including Lees-Edwards offset) to a separation.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
