    "num_native_engine_box_periodic_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fully periodic box.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_set_cell_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Sets the general cell matrix (rows are lattice vectors), refreshing `len` and the inverse. # Errors Fails if the matrix is singular.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_set_cell_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Sets the general cell matrix (rows are lattice vectors), refreshing `len` and the inverse. # Errors Fails if the matrix is singular.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_set_cell_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Sets the general cell matrix (rows are lattice vectors), refreshing `len` and the inverse. # Errors Fails if the matrix is singular.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_to_fractional_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fractional coordinates `s` with `x = sum_k s_k a_k` (orthorhombic: `x / L`).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_to_fractional_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fractional coordinates `s` with `x = sum_k s_k a_k` (orthorhombic: `x / L`).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_to_fractional_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fractional coordinates `s` with `x = sum_k s_k a_k` (orthorhombic: `x / L`).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_triclinic_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fully periodic triclinic box with lattice vectors `h[k]` (rows). # Errors Fails if the lattice vectors are linearly dependent.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_triclinic_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fully periodic triclinic box with lattice vectors `h[k]` (rows). # Errors Fails if the lattice vectors are linearly dependent.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_triclinic_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Fully periodic triclinic box with lattice vectors `h[k]` (rows). # Errors Fails if the lattice vectors are linearly dependent.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_volume_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Volume (length in 1-D, area in 2-D).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_volume_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Volume (length in 1-D, area in 2-D).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_box_volume_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Volume (length in 1-D, area in 2-D).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_chain_energy" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Thermostat contribution to the conserved quantity.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_chain_new" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Chain of `m` thermostats with relaxation time `tau`.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_chain_propagate" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Propagates the chain for `h / 2` and returns the velocity scale factor (`ke2` is `sum m v^2` before the call).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_compute_forces_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Evaluates all forces, rebuilding the neighbour list when needed. Above `MD_PAR_MIN_PAIRS` candidate pairs the pair sum is split into blocks of a size that depends only on the list length; the blocks run concurrently and are added in block order, so the result is independent of the thread count (it differs from the single-accumulator sum of shorter lists in the last bits). # Errors Propagates [`ForceField::validate`] errors.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_compute_forces_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Evaluates all forces, rebuilding the neighbour list when needed. Above `MD_PAR_MIN_PAIRS` candidate pairs the pair sum is split into blocks of a size that depends only on the list length; the blocks run concurrently and are added in block order, so the result is independent of the thread count (it differs from the single-accumulator sum of shorter lists in the last bits). # Errors Propagates [`ForceField::validate`] errors.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_compute_forces_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Evaluates all forces, rebuilding the neighbour list when needed. Above `MD_PAR_MIN_PAIRS` candidate pairs the pair sum is split into blocks of a size that depends only on the list length; the blocks run concurrently and are added in block order, so the result is independent of the thread count (it differs from the single-accumulator sum of shorter lists in the last bits). # Errors Propagates [`ForceField::validate`] errors.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_energy_drift_slope" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Least-squares slope of the energy against time (the energy drift rate).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_cell_dof" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Number of independent cell degrees of freedom.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_energy" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Cell contribution to the conserved quantity at volume `v`: `sum p_g^2/(2W) + P V (+ chain)`.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_hydrostatic" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Hydrostatic barostat at pressure `p0` with piston mass `w`.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_shear_flow" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. SLLOD shear flow on a deforming cell: the velocity gradient `u_x = rate * y` is imposed (no cell dynamics), particles obey `dr/dt = v + G r`, `dv/dt = F/m - G v`, and the lattice vectors are advected by the flow and reduced (lattice-equivalent re-wrapping) when the shear exceeds half a box. Combine with a Nose-Hoover chain or Langevin thermostat acting on the peculiar velocities. Requires `d >= 2`.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_with_chain" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Couples a Nose-Hoover chain of `m` thermostats (relaxation time `tau`, temperature `t0`) to the cell.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_with_langevin_cell" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Adds a Langevin piston with the given friction (see [`FlexibleBarostat::cell_friction`]).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_flexible_with_tensor" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Same with a general target pressure tensor (row-major).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_add_extra" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_new_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. New force field with the given pair terms and cutoff.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_new_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. New force field with the given pair terms and cutoff.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_new_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. New force field with the given pair terms and cutoff.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_rebuild_exclusions_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Rebuilds the exclusion table (call after changing bonded terms).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_rebuild_exclusions_d2" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Rebuilds the exclusion table (call after changing bonded terms).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_rebuild_exclusions_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Rebuilds the exclusion table (call after changing bonded terms).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_forcefield_set_bonded_d1" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
