    "num_native_engine_forcefield_validate_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Validates the force field for dimension `D`. # Errors Dihedrals need `D = 3`; angles need `D >= 2`.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
