    "num_native_engine_system_remove_com_velocity_d3" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work. Removes the centre-of-mass velocity.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_engine_system_set_state_d1" => "Actual native MD method with checked physical or explicitly reduced reference frames. Shapes, finite state, object identity and allocation/work limits precede native work.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
