    "num_native_graphics_dot_product_3d" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the dot product of two 3D vectors; the explicitly named 3D sibling of [`dot_product_2d`] (identical to [`dot_product`]).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_identity_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Identity 4x4 matrix.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_inner" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
