    "num_native_graphics_look_at_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 look-at view matrix. # Arguments * `eye` - Camera position. * `center` - Point the camera is looking at. * `up` - Up direction vector.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_orthographic_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 orthographic projection matrix.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_perspective_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 perspective projection matrix. # Arguments * `fov_y` - Field of view in the y-direction (radians). * `aspect` - Aspect ratio (width / height). * `near` - Distance to the near clipping plane. * `far` - Distance to the far clipping plane.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
