    "num_native_graphics_quaternion_to_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Converts the quaternion to a 4x4 rotation matrix.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_ray_at" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Returns the point at parameter t along the ray.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_ray_new" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Creates a new ray.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_ray_plane_intersection" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes ray-plane intersection.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_ray_sphere_intersection" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes ray-sphere intersection. Returns the closest intersection with t > 0, or `None` if no intersection.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_ray_triangle_intersection" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Intersects a ray with a triangle using a minimum ray parameter of `1e-6`. Use [`PreparedTriangle`] to reuse triangle geometry or specify another parameter range. The returned normal follows the vertex winding.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_reflect" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the reflection of a vector about a normal. R = I - 2(N·I)N, where I is the incident vector and N is the normal.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_refract" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the refraction of a vector through a surface. Uses Snell's law with `eta` = n1/n2 (ratio of refractive indices). Returns `None` for total internal reflection.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_rotation_matrix_axis" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 rotation matrix around an arbitrary axis. Uses the Rodrigues' rotation formula.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_rotation_matrix_x" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 rotation matrix around the X-axis.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_rotation_matrix_y" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 rotation matrix around the Y-axis.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_rotation_matrix_z" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 rotation matrix around the Z-axis.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_scaling_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 scaling matrix.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_shearing_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 shearing matrix. # Arguments * `xy` - Shear X by Y * `xz` - Shear X by Z * `yx` - Shear Y by X * `yz` - Shear Y by Z * `zx` - Shear Z by X * `zy` - Shear Z by Y\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_slerp" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Spherical linear interpolation (slerp) between two vectors. Useful for smooth rotation interpolation.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_sphere_new" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Creates a new sphere.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_transform_point" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Applies a 4x4 transformation matrix to a 3D point.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_transform_vector" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Applies a 4x4 transformation matrix to a 3D vector (ignores translation).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_translation_matrix" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 translation matrix.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
