    "num_native_graphics_vector2_components" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_vector2_magnitude" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the magnitude (length) of the vector.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_vector2_new" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Creates a new 2D vector.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_vector2_normalize" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Normalizes the vector to have a magnitude of 1.\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
    "num_native_graphics_vector2_perpendicular" => "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Returns the perpendicular vector (90 degrees counter-clockwise).\n\nReturns an unevaluated term; call `compute` to reduce it. Pass `checked=true` to call it with native arguments and receive a Value.",
